{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And it grew great</b> — Gabriel interpreted this likewise, 'and against the host of heaven, the prince of the host'—who is Michael. Do you not see, 'and the Ancient of Days sat down,' and it is written, 'and at that time Michael shall stand up.'"], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {0 "The Hebrew interpolates the phrase וככה ('likewise') before Gabriel's interpretation; rendered adverbially."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:20:26.512568302Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}